<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Tanya AI - Toko Ariesta</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-rose-50/60 text-gray-700 flex flex-col min-h-screen">

  <!-- Panggil partial navbar -->
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <!-- Konten utama percakapan AI -->
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 flex-grow w-full">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-rose-900 mb-1">Tanya Asisten AI 🤖✨</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-6">Tanyakan seputar stok, harga, atau jadwal pengiriman toko.</p>

    <!-- Box tampilan riwayat percakapan -->
    <section class="bg-white border border-rose-100 rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-4 h-64 overflow-y-auto mb-4 space-y-3">
      <div class="bg-rose-100/70 text-rose-950 p-3.5 rounded-2xl rounded-tl-none max-w-md text-xs leading-relaxed">
        <p class="font-bold text-rose-600 mb-1">Asisten AI 🌸</p>
        <p>Halo! Ada yang bisa saya bantu seputar stok atau harga di Toko Ariesta hari ini?</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Form kirim pertanyaan chat -->
    <form class="flex flex-col gap-2">
      <label for="pertanyaan" class="font-bold text-rose-900 text-xs">Tulis pertanyaan kamu:</label>
      <div class="flex gap-2">
        <input type="text" id="pertanyaan" name="pertanyaan" placeholder="Contoh: Telur 1kg ready ga ya?" class="border border-rose-200 p-3 rounded-xl flex-grow focus:outline-rose-400 text-sm" required>
        <button type="submit" class="bg-rose-500 text-white font-bold px-5 py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-rose-600 transition text-sm shadow-sm">Kirim</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </main>

  <!-- Panggil partial footer -->
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>